anti_patterns:
- id: ap_ind_residence_building__any_c5dcc23f
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: residence_building
  sheet: ''
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T12:48:39+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T12:48:39+08:00'
  action: block_dry_run
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 限时活动,activity_id,reward_id,item_id,兑换券,新增
  rationale: 输入为新增活动/奖励包/道具/邮件类实体配置，却落库到无关的 residence_building 表，属意图-表路由错配，应阻断并核实路由而非直接执行
- id: ap_ind_residence_building__any_41deebf0
  type: failed_operation
  table_stem: residence_building
  sheet: ''
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T12:48:39+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T12:48:39+08:00'
  action: block_dry_run
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 未知错误类型,retry,兜底,unresolved
  rationale: 错误类型无法识别时走通用 error_feedback retry 兜底，4 次重试均耗尽仍 unresolved，重复尝试无修复价值，应阻断并上报错误归类
- id: ap_ind_residence_building_BuildingType_0498eecd
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: residence_building
  sheet: BuildingType
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T12:53:15+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T12:53:15+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 法宝,阴阳权重,spell_id,玄火灼烧,quest_id,next_quest_ids,reward_id,hero_id,HPMaxCon
  rationale: 输入为跨多实体多表（法宝/技能/任务/奖励/角色）的综合修改，且不含目标表名；自动定位被错误路由到 residence_building/BuildingType，全部
    4 次失败均落在此无关表。此类跨实体批量修改应先确认每项的目标表名再执行。
- id: ap_ind_residence_building_BuildingType_0536ac72
  type: failed_operation
  table_stem: residence_building
  sheet: BuildingType
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T12:53:15+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T12:53:15+08:00'
  action: block_dry_run
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: verify_repair_exhausted,error_feedback,retry,未知错误类型
  rationale: 同一目标表连续 4 次触发 verify_repair_exhausted，错误详情均为'未知错误类型，走通用 error_feedback
    retry 兜底'，说明该表操作缺少明确错误分类，重试只会重复失败，应阻断并在修复路由后重试。
- id: ap_ind_item_ItemBase_998bc17d
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: item
  sheet: ItemBase
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T12:56:58+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T12:56:58+08:00'
  action: block_dry_run
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 删除,delete,废弃任务,任务,NPC,奖励包
  rationale: 任务/奖励相关配置行的删除操作被 ap_fail_item_ItemBase_delete_row 高风险反模式拦截，说明此类删除已标记为不可自动执行的高危操作，命中时应阻断并转人工处理，而非重试。
- id: ap_ind_item_Fabao_15315870
  type: ambiguous_column
  table_stem: item
  sheet: Fabao
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T12:56:58+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T12:56:58+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 权重,属性描述,倍率,元素,Fabao,法宝,spell_id
  rationale: 对 item/Fabao 表的多次修改均以未知错误类型兜底且 col 为空，说明自然语言字段（阴阳权重、属性描述、伤害倍率、元素等）未能映射到真实列名，命中时应先确认列映射再写入。
- id: ap_ind_residence_building__any_ccc8c62f
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: residence_building
  sheet: ''
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T13:25:10+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T13:25:10+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 新增,聚灵塔,建筑类型,ID
  rationale: 新增配置时直接沿用用户指定的固定 ID（building_type 12、item 22198），与表中已有主键冲突，11 次重试全部因主键重复失败；触发时应先核对
    ID 占用情况或改用自增分配，避免盲目写入
- id: ap_ind_residence_building_BuildingInteract_9aae8fcd
  type: failed_operation
  table_stem: residence_building
  sheet: BuildingInteract
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T13:25:10+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T13:25:10+08:00'
  action: block_dry_run
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 新增,建筑,主键重复,冲突
  rationale: 同一新增操作以相同 ID 连续重试 11 次，均因主键重复/ID 冲突报 verify_repair_exhausted，repair 策略耗尽仍未解决；应停止重试并改为重新分配可用
    ID 或人工介入，而不是复用失败 ID
- id: ap_ind_residence_building__any_92729d27
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: residence_building
  sheet: ''
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T13:29:13+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T13:29:13+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 新增,聚灵塔,building_type,ResidenceBuildingCollect
  rationale: 同一聚灵塔配表任务被重复执行：前几轮已成功写入 BuildingType 行16、ResidenceBuilding 行104、BuildingInteract
    行9，后续 11 轮仍以 add 方式重复写入相同主键（building_type=12、item_id=22198），触发主键重复且 verify 修复耗尽（id_reallocate
    重分配只会产生重复实体，并非正解）。触发特征：输入要求「新增」指定了已存在 ID 的实体。命中时应先校验主键是否已存在，已存在则改为更新或跳过。
- id: ap_ind_activity_Activity_151852dd
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: activity
  sheet: Activity
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T14:28:27+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T14:28:27+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 新增,activity_id,主键重复,ID冲突
  rationale: 同一活动新增指令连续 8 次均报"主键重复或 ID 冲突"且 id_reallocate 重试无效，说明手工指定 activity_id
    与既有数据冲突并非偶发，重写重试无法自愈，需先人工确认该 ID 占用情况或改走主键自增分配，避免无限重试
  fix:
    auto_assign_pk: activity_id
- id: ap_ind_activity_Activity_fe72211b
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: activity
  sheet: Activity
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-19T14:28:27+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-19T14:28:27+08:00'
  action: warn_only
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 新增,结束时间
  rationale: 8 条输入的"结束时间"字段值均缺失（文本截断），新增类意图若携带必填字段不完整，反复重试只会持续失败，应在写入前校验必填字段完整性并提示用户补全
- id: ap_ind_pve_combat_npc_PveCombatNpc_c6ead2f2
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: pve_combat_npc
  sheet: PveCombatNpc
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T13:18:18+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T13:18:18+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 战斗,胜利奖励,失败奖励,平局奖励,奖励包
  rationale: 战斗配置中的奖励字段（胜利/失败/平局奖励）属于战斗主表，而 pve_combat_npc 是怪物/NPC 表，不含这些列；每次把带奖励字段的战斗意图路由到
    NPC 表都会触发列名不存在错误。命中时应确认字段归属表，并将奖励字段重定向到战斗主表或跳过该列。
- id: ap_ind_activity_Activity_90d2fb36
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: activity
  sheet: Activity
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T13:21:16+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T13:21:16+08:00'
  action: block_dry_run
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 新增,活动,activity_id
  rationale: '新增活动类数据在首次写入即连续命中 schema_missing: sheet 表头，说明目标 sheet 缺表头属环境性问题；在表头就绪前所有写入与校验结果（唯一约束、主键冲突）均不可信，应阻断后续重试而非软提示继续'
- id: ap_ind_activity_Activity_94b58284
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: activity
  sheet: Activity
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T13:21:16+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T13:21:16+08:00'
  action: warn_only
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: schema_missing,表头,主键重复
  rationale: 表头缺失后连锁触发两类误报：全列被报 unique_violation（活动id/名称/描述/起止时间均报唯一冲突）及主键重复/ID冲突；它们同源于
    schema 无法解析，不应逐列重试或走 id_reallocate 修复，应归因为一次 schema 问题
- id: ap_ind_activity_Activity_5d477c33
  type: failed_operation
  table_stem: activity
  sheet: Activity
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T13:21:16+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T13:21:16+08:00'
  action: block_dry_run
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 新增,活动,重试
  rationale: 同一输入被反复执行 18 次，在根因（缺表头）未修复前每次都以相同结果失败直至 verify_repair_exhausted，说明对同源失败的无脑重试是无价值循环，应限制单操作重试轮数并要求人工修复前置条件
- id: ap_ind_item_Fabao_dd8b722d
  type: failed_operation
  table_stem: item
  sheet: Fabao
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T13:27:29+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T13:27:29+08:00'
  action: block_dry_run
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 法宝,Fabao,item,28501
  rationale: 多条独立意图在 item/Fabao 表均报未知错误类型，走通用 error_feedback retry 兜底后仍 verify_repair_exhausted，且
    col 为空，说明表路由或列定位存在系统性异常，重试无法自愈，应阻断并人工排查 schema，避免空转重试
- id: ap_ind_item_Fabao_3ff1867b
  type: ambiguous_column
  table_stem: item
  sheet: Fabao
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T13:27:29+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T13:27:29+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 阴阳权重,阳属性描述,阴属性描述
  rationale: 三个意图执行后 col 均为空且底层报未知错误类型，疑似字段名（阴阳权重/阳属性描述/阴属性描述）未能映射到 Fabao 表真实列名，命中时应先向用户确认列映射而非直接写入
- id: ap_ind_residence_building_BuildingInteract_95ea2b9e
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: residence_building
  sheet: BuildingInteract
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T13:28:20+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T13:28:20+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 聚灵塔,building_type,交互动画,idle,collect,状态
  rationale: 同一条指令要求为同一建筑类型(building_type=12)写入两条交互动画(idle/collect)，第一条idle写入成功，后续所有collect行均报'主键重复'。说明该表主键实为building_type单列，同一类型无法存多个状态行；且此前重试策略id_reallocate不可用——重分配主键会破坏用户要求的building_type值。该需求模式(一类型多状态交互)会反复触发同类冲突。
- id: ap_ind_quest_QuestGroup_50b1aac1
  type: ambiguous_column
  table_stem: quest
  sheet: QuestGroup
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T17:22:41+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T17:22:41+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 主线任务,任务组,限定条件,任务描述
  rationale: 任务描述/目标类型/战斗编号/奖励包/限定条件等字段属于任务表(Quest)，而非任务组表(QuestGroup)只含组ID/组名/类型，整组任务字段塞入QuestGroup导致7列连续col_not_found
- id: ap_ind_pve_combat_npc_PveCombatNpc_7e51bf43
  type: ambiguous_column
  table_stem: pve_combat_npc
  sheet: PveCombatNpc
  trigger: ai_induced
