  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 战斗,怪物,坐标,PVE
  rationale: 战斗怪属性表(PveCombatNpc)无坐标列，坐标属于刷怪/生成配置表，误随战斗怪属性写入导致坐标列不存在且引发主键冲突
- id: ap_ind_reward_Reward_7496b389
  type: ambiguous_column
  table_stem: reward
  sheet: Reward
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T17:22:41+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T17:22:41+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 奖励包,每日限领,必给数量,奖励包编号
  rationale: reward/Reward表头无'奖励包编号/每日限领次数/必给数量'列，字段名与真实表头不一致属列名映射错误，且同批出现主键冲突
- id: ap_ind_entity_prefab_Base_eb742ead
  type: ambiguous_column
  table_stem: entity_prefab
  sheet: Base
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T17:22:41+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T17:22:41+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: NPC,model_id,对话内容,引导
  rationale: entity_prefab/Base仅承载预制体基础字段(ID/名称/model等)，战场/坐标/对话内容等应分流至生成与交互表，全部写入Base导致5列col_not_found
- id: ap_ind__global__any_63821832
  type: failed_operation
  table_stem: ''
  sheet: ''
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T17:22:41+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T17:22:41+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 任务号,战斗编号,奖励包编号,250600
  rationale: 多个表(reward/PveCombatNpc)连续出现'主键重复或ID冲突'且自动重分配策略已耗尽，用户指定ID可能与已有数据冲突，应回写前确认新ID而非自动分配
- id: ap_ind_residence_building__any_0776c3d8
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: residence_building
  sheet: ''
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T18:22:20+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T18:22:20+08:00'
  action: warn_only
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 新增,建筑,等级,图标,数量上限,所属州,prefab_id
  rationale: 新增配置类指令中，「数量上限-洞府等级1」「建筑等级」「地图图标id」「升级所需洞府等级」「所属州id」「正式入口prefab_id」等业务上允许重复的非唯一列反复触发
    unique_violation 软校验，属校验器将非唯一列纳入唯一性检查的误报，同源高频出现，应仅提示不阻断
- id: ap_ind_residence_entry_District_7acda8d3
  type: type_constraint
  table_stem: residence_entry
  sheet: District
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T18:22:20+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T18:22:20+08:00'
  action: warn_only
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 坐标,(-150,15,-880),pos_list
  rationale: 用户以字符串文本 (-150,15,-880) 提供坐标，而目标列「选后传送」期望类型为 list[tuple[float,float,float]]，字符串与结构化类型不匹配，属类型约束反模式，应提示需将坐标解析为数值三元组后再写入
- id: ap_ind_quest__any_d4cab267
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: quest
  sheet: ''
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T19:22:47+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T19:22:47+08:00'
  action: warn_only
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 查询,第一行,读取
  rationale: 只读查询指令（如'查询XX表第一行'）被误当作写操作进入校验修复流程，修复重试耗尽后走通用兜底仍无法解决，应识别为读操作直接返回数据而非走
    verify_repair
- id: ap_ind_pet__any_420be467
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: pet
  sheet: ''
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-20T19:37:04+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-20T19:37:04+08:00'
  action: warn_only
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 查看,所有属性,查询,只读
  rationale: 查看/查询类指令被误路由进写入校验流程（如 set 操作），导致该校验体系无法处理的未知错误类型，走 error_feedback retry
    兜底后仍无法解决；此类只读请求不应经过写前校验/修复链路。
- id: ap_ind_quest_Quest_d83e1e80
  type: semantic_pattern
  table_stem: quest
  sheet: Quest
  trigger: ai_induced
  occurrences: 1
  first_seen: '2026-08-21T10:16:19+08:00'
  last_seen: '2026-08-21T10:16:19+08:00'
  action: require_confirm
  status: pending_review
  source: ai_induction
  trigger_pattern: 删掉,废弃任务,连带清掉,一并删掉,next_quest_ids,spawn_quest_entity,reward
  rationale: 级联删除指令（主任务删除+引用清理+关联表删除）被路由到无关表导致定位全面失败：规则路由到 _test_item 而非 quest，多表操作未拆分成子意图，表/sheet/col
    全部为空且 unresolved。同类级联清理指令（含'连带/一并'关联表清理、next_quest_ids 引用清理）会重复出现，应先正确路由到主表 quest
    并拆分为 quest/spawn_quest_entity/reward 多个子操作，且删除类高危操作需确认目标表归属。
- id: ap_ind__global__any_8dd1da7b
  type: semantic_pattern
